request.description:
Returns all schools sorted by distance (nearest first) from the provided coordinates. Distance is calculated using the Haversine formula and returned in kilometres.

**200 Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Green Valley School",
      "address": "123 Main Street, Delhi",
      "latitude": 28.6139,
      "longitude": 77.209,
      "distance_km": 0
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "Delhi Public School",
      "address": "Sector 45, Noida",
      "latitude": 28.5706,
      "longitude": 77.3216,
      "distance_km": 12
    }
  ]
}
```

**400 — Missing or invalid coordinates:**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "errors": [
    { "field": "latitude", "message": "Latitude must be between -90 and 90" }
  ]
}
```

